# Single line-ending policy: LF in the repo AND in the working tree (all platforms).
# Why: frontend/dist/ is committed and CI checks `git diff --exit-code -- dist` after a
# fresh build. Vite copies frontend/*.html and public/* into dist byte-for-byte, so a CRLF
# working tree (Windows autocrlf) produced CRLF dist files that differed from CI's LF build.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.xlsx binary
*.html text eol=lf
*.svg text eol=lf
*.csv text eol=lf
*.js text eol=lf
*.css text eol=lf
